<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>Now I see, there’s something more to this pattern:</l><l>You want to show me all that You are.</l><l>So You’ve drawn me from this strife, into the family life.</l><l>As one, our prayers can match Your deep desires.</l><l>Now behold we follow You together!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
